  "text": "Skip to content\nFully insured shipping\nAuthenticity guaranteed\nWe buy it back\nNYC Diamond District counter\nSecure checkout\n100 Gram Gold Bar Random Brands With Assay\nby\nRANDOM\n$\n13,901.90\nPriced live off the spot market.\nSee price history ↓\nPurity\n99.99\nOut of stock\nAdd to wishlist\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nFully insured shipping\nShips in 1–3 business days\nWe buy it back —\nsell to us\nSecure checkout · NYC Diamond District counter\nCategories:\n100 Gram Gold Bars\n,\nGold Bars\n,\nGram Gold Bars\nMint:\nRANDOM\nPrice history\n100 Gram Gold Bar Random Brands With Assay was last recorded at $13,891.32 on September 30, 2026. Over the past 12 months it is up 10.8% and has ranged between $12,540.79 and $18,923.79.\nLast recorded\nLoading…\n1Y\n7D\n1M\n3M\n6M\n1Y\nAll\nDescription\nAdditional information\nDescription\nDescription\nWe bring a cost-effective way for gold investors and collectors to a .9999 pure gold bar without regard for the design. You can now purchase 100 gram Gold Bar (Random Brand) with .9999 purity which comes with an assay card now from Bullion Trading LLC.\nFor us quality of the precious metals and customer satisfaction always come first. And thus, you can be fully assured that the gold bar we carry is top quality and from the most reputable mints/refineries of the bullion industry.\nDesign of 100 Gram Gold Bar – Random (In Assay)\nThe design and engraving on the obverse and reverse of the 100\nGram Gold Bar\n– Random Bar depends on the available gold bars in our inventory at the time of your order. The product picture presented here is just for the representation of the gold bar. The product you receive may or may not be the exact item.\nMain Highlights of 100 Gram Gold Bar – Random (In Assay)\n100-gram gold bar (3.215 troy oz) of .9999 pure gold\nIt comes with an assay card to prove the metal quantity, purity, and authenticity of the bar\nThe mint and design of the bar are picked depending on the available stock\nThe reverse and reverse features of the bar may vary\nProduct Specifications: 100 Gram Gold Bar – Random (In Assay)\nSpecification\nDetails\nMetal\nGold\nMint\nVaries\nYear Minted\nRandom\nGrade Service\nAssay Card\nGross Weight\n100  Gram\nMetal Weight\n3.215\nPurity\n.9999\nThickness\nVaries\nDimension\nVaries\nBuy 100 Gram Gold Bar – Random (In Assay) at Bullion Trading LLC\nProviding our services for over 30 years, Bullion Trading LLC has established itself as a reputable name and precious metal expert. Believing that precious metals are a sound investment and everyone must get the chance to own a piece of it, we often run special offers and price slash. We present the cost-effective way to own gold with our 100 Gram Gold Bar – Random (In Assay), now available for purchase.\nTo know about our 100-gram Gold Bar – Random (In Assay), or on any of our precious metals, or for precious metal investment guidance, don’t hesitate to message us on our live chat or at\n[email protected]\n. For direct contact, you can call us at 646-362-3536 or visit the Bullion Trading LLC store at 20 West 47th Street, Lower Level #24, New York, NY 10036.\nAdditional information\nProduct Type\nbullion\nIssuer Country\nOther\nIs Legal Tender\nNo\nIs Monetized Bullion\nNo\nPurity %\n99.99\nRelated products\nQty\nAdd to cart\nGold Bars\n,\n10 Gram Gold Bars\n,\nGram Gold Bars\n10 Gram Gold Bar – PAMP Suisse Lady Fortuna (In Assay)\n$\n1,481.32\nQty\nAdd to cart\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nOut of stock\nRead more\n50 Gram Gold Bars\n,\nGold Bars\n,\nGram Gold Bars\n50 Gram PAMP Suisse Gold Bar – Lady Fortuna(In Assay)\n$\n7,114.35\nRead more\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nOut of stock\nRead more\n1 oz Gold Bars\n,\nGold Bars\n,\nReligious Collection\n1 Oz Gold Bar – PAMP Suisse Horse (In Assay)\n$\n4,386.97\nRead more\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nQty\nAdd to cart\nGold Bars\n,\n10 oz Gold Bars\n,\nGold Bullion\n10 oz Gold Bar Pamp Suisse Lady Fortuna(